cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AI4OrgChem, please cite this software release and the associated manuscript."
title: "AI4OrgChem: an AI for Science agent for independent computational evidence assessment in organic chemistry"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chen
    given-names: Xiao
    email: chenxiao0101@gmail.com
version: 0.3.2
date-released: 2026-09-13
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  AI4OrgChem is an AI for Science agent assessing fourteen counter-traditional
  propositions in organic structure theory through independent computation,
  layered evidence, explicit scope boundaries, public core software, and
  bounded machine-learning experiments. Version 0.3.2 corrects the P12 evidence
  interpretation without new quantum-chemical results or reclassification.
keywords:
  - AI for Science
  - computational chemistry
  - organic chemistry
  - localized fragment molecular orbitals
  - energy decomposition
  - reproducible research
